{"hw":"πέμπτος","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">πέμπτος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">πέμπτος</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">η</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">πέντε</span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">fifth: with four others</b>, <span class=\"gk\">πέμπτος μετὰ τοῖσιν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.335</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">π. αὐτός</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.61</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.19</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">π. σπιθαμή</span>, i.e. four cubits and a span, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.106</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐς π. μῆνα</span> by <b class=\"lex-tr\">the fifth</b> month, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.77</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὸ πέμπτον μέρος</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">a fifth</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">36b</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">τὸ π</span>., as <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">for the fifth time</b>, <span class=\"gk\">ὕπατοι, ὑπατεύων</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.S.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">19.77</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fab.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">19</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἡ πέμπτη</span> (sc.<span class=\"gk\">ἡμέ